# Ignore everything in this directory
*

# Except .gitignore and the dotenv template.
# The live .env stays ignored here, unlike other services: Notifiarr's env is
# where its Notifiarr.com API key and the per-app servarr API keys live, so the
# real file is never committed. `make bootstrap` seeds it from .env.example.
!.gitignore
!.env.example

# config file
!config/
config/*
!config/notifiarr/
!config/notifiarr/*
